<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>CSS Layouts Demo — Block / Inline / Inline-Block / Float</title>
<style>
  /* ---------- GLOBAL ---------- */
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 20px;
    background: #f4f6f8;
  }
  h1 { font-size: 20px; margin-top: 30px; }
  h2 { font-size: 16px; color: #333; margin-bottom: 8px; }

  /* =====================================================
     TASK 1: Block vs Inline vs Inline-Block Sections
     ===================================================== */
  .section-block {
    display: block;              /* default for divs — full width, new line */
    background: #ffd8a8;
    border: 2px solid #e8590c;
    padding: 10px;
    margin: 6px 0;
  }

  .section-inline {
    display: inline;             /* sits on same line; width/height IGNORED */
    background: #b2f2bb;
    border: 2px solid #2f9e44;
    padding: 10px;
    /* width & height below will be IGNORED by the browser */
    width: 200px;
    height: 80px;
  }

  .section-inline-block {
    display: inline-block;       /* sits on same line; width/height RESPECTED */
    background: #a5d8ff;
    border: 2px solid #1971c2;
    padding: 10px;
    width: 200px;
    height: 80px;
    vertical-align: top;
    margin: 6px 4px;
  }

  /* =====================================================
     TASK 2: Instagram-style Nav Bar with inline-block
     ===================================================== */
  .insta-nav {
    background: #ffffff;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #dbdbdb;
    padding: 0 16px;
    /* font-size: 0 removes whitespace gaps between inline-block items */
    font-size: 0;
  }
  .insta-nav .logo {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: bold;
    font-style: italic;
    padding: 12px 20px 12px 0;
    vertical-align: middle;
    font-family: 'Brush Script MT', cursive;
  }
  .insta-nav .nav-item {
    display: inline-block;       /* side by side, but width/height work */
    width: 110px;
    height: 44px;
    line-height: 44px;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 15px;
    color: #262626;
    text-decoration: none;
    border-radius: 6px;
    transition: background 0.2s;
  }
  .insta-nav .nav-item:hover { background: #efefef; }

  /* =====================================================
     TASK 3: Two-Column Flipkart-style Layout with Floats
     TASK 4: Clearfix applied to parent
     ===================================================== */
  .flipkart-wrapper {
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid #ddd;
    padding: 12px;
    margin-top: 10px;
  }

  .product-list {
    float: left;
    width: 68%;
    background: #e7f5ff;
    padding: 12px;
    border: 1px solid #74c0fc;
  }
  .cart-sidebar {
    float: right;
    width: 28%;
    background: #fff3bf;
    padding: 12px;
    border: 1px solid #f59f00;
  }
  .product-card {
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid #ced4da;
    padding: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .cart-item {
    border-bottom: 1px dashed #f59f00;
    padding: 6px 0;
  }

  /* ---------- TASK 4: CLEARFIX ---------- */
  .clearfix::after {
    content: "";
    display: table;   /* or block */
    clear: both;
  }

  /* =====================================================
     TASK 5: Flexbox equivalent of the two-column layout
     ===================================================== */
  .flex-wrapper {
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid #ddd;
    padding: 12px;
    margin-top: 10px;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }
  .flex-wrapper .product-list {
    float: none;          /* no float needed */
    flex: 1 1 68%;
  }
  .flex-wrapper .cart-sidebar {
    float: none;
    flex: 0 0 28%;
  }

  /* Toggle helper: hide/show */
  .hidden { display: none; }
  .toggle-btn {
    margin-top: 10px;
    padding: 6px 12px;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<h1>1. Block vs Inline vs Inline-Block</h1>
<div class="section-block">Home (display: block — full width, new line)</div>
<span class="section-inline">Explore (display: inline — width/height ignored)</span>
<span class="section-inline">Profile (display: inline)</span>

<h1>2. Instagram-style Navigation (inline-block)</h1>
<nav class="insta-nav">
  <span class="logo">Instagram</span>
  <a href="#" class="nav-item">Home</a>
  <a href="#" class="nav-item">Search</a>
  <a href="#" class="nav-item">Explore</a>
  <a href="#" class="nav-item">Reels</a>
  <a href="#" class="nav-item">Profile</a>
</nav>

<h1>3 &amp; 4. Flipkart-style Two-Column Layout (float + clearfix)</h1>
<div class="flipkart-wrapper clearfix">
  <main class="product-list">
    <h2>Products</h2>
    <div class="product-card">📱 Smartphone — ₹15,999</div>
    <div class="product-card">💻 Laptop — ₹54,990</div>
    <div class="product-card">🎧 Headphones — ₹1,299</div>
    <div class="product-card">⌚ Smartwatch — ₹2,499</div>
    <div class="product-card">🖱️ Mouse — ₹499</div>
    <div class="product-card">⌨️ Keyboard — ₹899</div>
  </main>

  <aside class="cart-sidebar">
    <h2>🛒 Cart</h2>
    <div class="cart-item">Smartphone × 1</div>
    <div class="cart-item">Headphones × 2</div>
    <div class="cart-item">Mouse × 1</div>
    <p><strong>Total: ₹19,296</strong></p>
  </aside>
</div>

<h1>5. Same Layout Rebuilt with Flexbox</h1>
<div class="flex-wrapper">
  <main class="product-list">
    <h2>Products (Flex child)</h2>
    <div class="product-card">📱 Smartphone — ₹15,999</div>
    <div class="product-card">💻 Laptop — ₹54,990</div>
    <div class="product-card">🎧 Headphones — ₹1,299</div>
  </main>
  <aside class="cart-sidebar">
    <h2>🛒 Cart</h2>
    <div class="cart-item">Smartphone × 1</div>
    <div class="cart-item">Headphones × 2</div>
  </aside>
</div>

</body>
</html>
